  "title": "Navy Rescues Missing Fisherman Off Oahu",
  "description": "210326-N-SF508-0001 HONOLULU, Hawaii (March 26, 2021) An overdue\r\nboater is rescued by a U.S. Navy MH-60R Sea Hawk helicopter assigned\r\nto the \"EasyRiders\" of Helicopter Maritime Strike Squadron 37 (HSM 37)\r\nin the waters off Oahu. The Naval aircrew located the boater following\r\nan overnight search, and transported him to a local civilian medical\r\ncenter to receive treatment. (U.S. Navy Video/Released)",
